id: pm-gantt-chart-sdk-docs
title: Migrate Gantt toolchain contracts and document the declared SDK minimum
description: "For PR #212, migrate the November 4 toolchain, model native blocked-start refusals in both 500-sequence SDK laws, keep installation docs/tests on the declared consumer minimum, derive packed hosts from the development pin, and explicitly render daily empty tracker-selected release windows. https://github.com/unbraind/pm-gantt-chart/pull/212"
